---
// about.astro — About Archex: Philosophy, Practices & Accountability
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Archex"
  description="Archex brings together technology, creative thinking and go-to-market expertise to help ideas become meaningful products, experiences and businesses."
  canonical="https://www.archexweb.in/about/"
  activePath="/about"
>
  <div class="shell page-container">
    <!-- Breadcrumb / Tag -->
    <div class="page-meta">
      <span class="tech-tag tech-tag--signal">The Parent Brand</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">
        Independent thinking.<br />
        Purposeful execution<span class="hl-dot">.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        Archex brings together technology, creative thinking and go-to-market expertise to help ideas become meaningful products, experiences and businesses.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Editorial Prose Sections -->
    <div class="editorial-layout">
      <!-- Main Content Column -->
      <div class="editorial-content">
        <section class="editorial-section">
          <h2 class="editorial-section-title">Why Archex exists</h2>
          <p>
            Digital initiatives often fail not from a shortage of effort, but from fractured execution. A company engages a design firm for brand identity, an engineering agency for software development, and an external marketing consultancy for launch strategy. When these disciplines work in silos, the end result is almost always compromised: software that ignores user reality, brand identities that cannot scale technically, or products built without market validation.
          </p>
          <p>
            Archex exists to eliminate that division. We are a parent brand and operational ecosystem designed to bring technical engineering, brand identity, and commercial go-to-market execution into one coherent conversation.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="editorial-section">
          <h2 class="editorial-section-title">The three practices</h2>
          <p>
            Instead of operating as a generic, bloated agency, Archex functions through three distinct, specialized practices:
          </p>

          <div class="practice-deep-dive">
            <div class="deep-dive-card">
              <div class="deep-dive-header">
                <span class="deep-dive-num">01</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="deep-dive-title">Archex Craft</h3>
                  <span class="deep-dive-sub">Software engineering & product development</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>
                Craft focuses on thoughtful software engineering, web application development, intelligent systems and digital product architectures. From early prototype to resilient production systems, Craft ensures technical decisions are durable, secure and scalable.
              </p>
              <a href="https://craft.archexweb.in/" class="deep-dive-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Explore Archex Craft (craft.archexweb.in) ↗
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="deep-dive-card">
              <div class="deep-dive-header">
                <span class="deep-dive-num">02</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="deep-dive-title">Archex Studio</h3>
                  <span class="deep-dive-sub">Brand identity & digital experiences</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>
                Studio shapes brand identity, creative direction, UI/UX systems and digital experiences. The focus is on clarity, typographic poise and purposeful design that communicates meaning rather than aesthetic superficiality.
              </p>
              <a href="https://studio.archexweb.in/" class="deep-dive-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Explore Archex Studio (studio.archexweb.in) ↗
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="deep-dive-card">
              <div class="deep-dive-header">
                <span class="deep-dive-num">03</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="deep-dive-title">Archex GTM</h3>
                  <span class="deep-dive-sub">Go-to-market strategy & execution</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>
                GTM addresses market research, ideal customer profiling, positioning, pricing, launch strategy, customer acquisition and growth experiments. It ensures products find viable routes to their intended audiences.
              </p>
              <a href="https://gtm.archexweb.in/" class="deep-dive-link">
                Explore Archex GTM (gtm.archexweb.in) ↗
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="editorial-section">
          <h2 class="editorial-section-title">Our approach to solving problems</h2>
          <p>
            We operate on independent thinking and first principles. Rather than following transient industry templates or buzzwords, we interrogate the core problem:
          </p>
          <ul class="editorial-bullet-list">
            <li><strong>Clarity over ornamentation:</strong> We prioritize functional clarity, clean architecture, and verifiable utility before visual decoration.</li>
            <li><strong>Disciplined enquiry:</strong> We question assumptions early, identifying technical bottlenecks, commercial risks, and usability flaws before significant resources are spent.</li>
            <li><strong>Flexible collaboration:</strong> Clients can engage with any practice independently, or activate multiple practices collaboratively as their project requires.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="editorial-section">
          <h2 class="editorial-section-title">Commitment to thoughtful execution & accountability</h2>
          <p>
            Execution is where ideas either validate themselves or dissolve. Archex is committed to rigorous craft, disciplined delivery timelines, and transparent communication. We take full accountability for what we recommend, build, and deploy.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not manufacture exaggerated claims, artificial credentials, or impossible guarantees. We focus on dependable work that delivers measurable value to the businesses and users who rely on it.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Navigation Next Steps -->
        <div class="about-action-banner">
          <div class="action-banner-text">
            <h3 class="action-banner-heading">Ready to discuss your project?</h3>
            <p class="action-banner-sub">
              Tell us what you are working on. We will help direct your enquiry to the right practice.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="https://craft.archexweb.in/contact" class="btn-base btn-primary">
            <span>Start a conversation</span>
            <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar / Quick Overview -->
      <aside class="editorial-sidebar" aria-label="Ecosystem summary">
        <div class="sidebar-card">
          <span class="sidebar-title">Ecosystem at a glance</span>
          <dl class="sidebar-dl">
            <dt>Parent Brand</dt>
            <dd>Archex (archexweb.in)</dd>

            <dt>Practices</dt>
            <dd>Craft, Studio, GTM</dd>

            <dt>Engagement Model</dt>
            <dd>Independent or Integrated</dd>

            <dt>Core Philosophy</dt>
            <dd>Independent thinking. Purposeful execution.</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-card">
          <span class="sidebar-title">Direct practice destinations</span>
          <ul class="sidebar-links">
            <li>
              <a href="https://craft.archexweb.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <span>Archex Craft</span>
                <span class="link-arrow">↗</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://studio.archexweb.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <span>Archex Studio</span>
                <span class="link-arrow">↗</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://gtm.archexweb.in">
                <span>Archex GTM (Coming Soon)</span>
                <span class="link-arrow">↗</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-top: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(60px, 9vw, 110px);
  }

  .page-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .page-date-note {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(44px, 6vw, 68px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 48px);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 68px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hl-dot {
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.8vw, 22px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-graphite);
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  /* Editorial Layout */
  .editorial-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px;
    gap: clamp(36px, 6vw, 72px);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .editorial-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
  }

  .editorial-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .editorial-section-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.2;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }

  .editorial-section p {
    font-size: 16.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .practice-deep-dive {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .deep-dive-card {
    background-color: var(--paper-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .deep-dive-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .deep-dive-num {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .deep-dive-title {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .deep-dive-sub {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .deep-dive-link {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 6px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .deep-dive-link:hover {
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .editorial-bullet-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .editorial-bullet-list li {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .editorial-bullet-list li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--signal);
    font-family: var(--mono);
  }

  .about-action-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    background-color: var(--paper-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 36px);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .action-banner-text {
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .action-banner-heading {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .action-banner-sub {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink-graphite);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  .editorial-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-height) + 24px);
  }

  .sidebar-card {
    background-color: var(--paper-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .sidebar-title {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }

  .sidebar-dl {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sidebar-dl dt {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .sidebar-dl dd {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 2px 0 0 0;
  }

  .sidebar-links {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .sidebar-links a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    padding: 8px 10px;
    background-color: var(--paper-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .sidebar-links a:hover {
    border-color: var(--signal);
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .link-arrow {
    font-family: var(--mono);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .editorial-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .editorial-sidebar {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>

